    frontlet:hasComment "An eyewitness report: 320 lost at sea on the night of 28 April 2011, after the shipwreck off the coast of Zuwara a direct boat to Lampedusa. Another dozen or so passengers on a second boat fell into the sea and drowned during the same night, because of the storm (May 21, 2011) | Drowned | lampedusa | Libya | Fortress Europe | http://fortresseurope.blogspot.com/2011/05/il-naufragio-fantasma-un-testimone-320.html | Libya | Italy",
