    rdfs:label "Collective event 417" ;
    frontlet:hasNarrative "Lost at sea a boat with 25 passengers on board. Locked in a stormy sea 47 miles off the Libyan coast, on Thursday raised the alarm. Malta had asked Libya to intervene, but Tripoli had sent a reconnaissance plane in only two days later. An Iranian cargo ship 20 miles away from the castaways had wanted them not help fearing they were armed (Jun 11, 2007)" ;
    frontlet:totalDeadAndMissing 25 .

